{#
  Renders one 'text' block (course_schema.json #/definitions/textBlock) — a plain paragraph
  with no wrapper, e.g. a chapter's opening sentence before the first callout.
  Expects: block (the text object), lang ('en' | 'ar')
#}
<p>{{ (block.body[lang] if block.body[lang] else block.body.en) | safe }}</p>
